</blockquote>
<p>Ok let me re-phrase that, I love the concepts here until it gets to killing everybody via memes.</p>
<p>You actually did a really good job making this not just some stupid basic jab at something political but it's still not anything I found to have to be interesting or to be disturbing in the ways it wants to be. As for the disrespectful parts it looks like several other people here worded it better so it's probably best if I leave it at that.</p>
</div>
